---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="About | Héctor Andrés Quintero Silva"
  description="About Héctor Andrés Quintero Silva."
>

<section>

  <h1>About</h1>

  <p class="about-lead">
    I'm Héctor Andrés Quintero Silva, an AI Platform Engineer focused on
    designing scalable backend systems, cloud-native architectures and
    production-ready AI platforms powered by Large Language Models.
  </p>

</section>

<section>

  <h2>Professional Mission</h2>

  <p>
    My mission is to build reliable AI platforms that enable organizations to
    deploy, manage and scale intelligent applications with confidence.
  </p>

  <p>
    I enjoy solving engineering challenges involving backend architecture,
    distributed systems, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), semantic search,
    API platforms and modern cloud technologies.
  </p>

</section>

<section>

  <h2>Engineering Focus</h2>

  <div class="about-grid">

    <div class="card">

      <h3>Backend Engineering</h3>

      <p>
        REST APIs, authentication, caching, asynchronous processing,
        PostgreSQL, Redis and scalable backend services built with FastAPI.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="card">

      <h3>AI Platform Engineering</h3>

      <p>
        LLM Gateway APIs, Prompt Management, Embedding Services,
        Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), semantic search and AI workflow
        orchestration.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="card">

      <h3>Cloud-Native Systems</h3>

      <p>
        Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD, observability, distributed services and
        cloud deployments designed for production environments.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>

<section>

  <h2>Technology Stack</h2>

  <div class="tech-stack">

    <span class="tech-pill">Python</span>
    <span class="tech-pill">FastAPI</span>
    <span class="tech-pill">PostgreSQL</span>
    <span class="tech-pill">Redis</span>
    <span class="tech-pill">Docker</span>
    <span class="tech-pill">Kubernetes</span>
    <span class="tech-pill">AWS</span>
    <span class="tech-pill">GitHub Actions</span>
    <span class="tech-pill">OpenAI API</span>
    <span class="tech-pill">Anthropic API</span>
    <span class="tech-pill">Gemini API</span>
    <span class="tech-pill">pgvector</span>
    <span class="tech-pill">LLMs</span>
    <span class="tech-pill">RAG</span>
    <span class="tech-pill">Embeddings</span>

  </div>

</section>

<section>

  <h2>Professional Roadmap</h2>

  <p>
    My portfolio is structured as a long-term engineering roadmap composed of
    thirty progressively more advanced projects. Each project focuses on real
    production scenarios, covering backend engineering, AI platforms,
    cloud-native infrastructure, distributed systems, observability, LLMOps and
    multi-agent architectures.
  </p>

  <p>
    The objective is to develop the practical experience required to design,
    build and operate enterprise-grade AI platforms following modern software
    engineering best practices.
  </p>

</section>

</MainLayout>